<br>&nbsp;<br>When we started Freedom Farms, our family farm, the mission was simple: <strong><span style="color: rgb(74, 144, 226);">SAVE AMERICAN FARMS</span></strong> and help families nationwide get access to delicious meats from animals born, raised, and processed in the USA.
<br><br>We were tired of seeing American families being fed lower-quality grocery store meats that are both poor quality and imported. While also watching real farms in <strong>America </strong>— run by hard working families disappear.
<br><br>Every year, more small farms shut down. And more control shifts to massive corporations and foreign entities purchasing American farms.
<br><br>The connection between families and their food is being lost.
<br><br>We refused to let that happen quietly.
<br><br>Because when you lose control of your food supply and your farms- <strong>you also lose your freedom.</strong></span></p><a data-to-section="pf-4ee7" data-offset="{&quot;all&quot;:50,&quot;laptop&quot;:50,&quot;tablet&quot;:50,&quot;mobile&quot;:50}" href="#" data-pf-type="Button2" class="sc-fbFjKN jShduQ pf-24_ pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide">Support American Farms</a></div><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-kpKSlO brELaQ pf-27_"><img alt="AMAZING!  Our story with The New York Post came out today!! We are incredibly proud and grateful.jpg__PID:a3c53eda-3f76-4802-8f95-c1692930aadc" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0529/2376/0823/files/AMAZING_Our_story_with_The_New_York_Post_came_out_today_We_are_incredibly_proud_and_grateful.jpg?v=1778799923&width=2048" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0529/2376/0823/files/AMAZING_Our_story_with_The_New_York_Post_came_out_today_We_are_incredibly_proud_and_grateful.jpg?v=1778799923&width=375 375w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0529/2376/0823/files/AMAZING_Our_story_with_The_New_York_Post_came_out_today_We_are_incredibly_proud_and_grateful.jpg?v=1778799923&width=550 550w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0529/2376/0823/files/AMAZING_Our_story_with_The_New_York_Post_came_out_today_We_are_incredibly_proud_and_grateful.jpg?v=1778799923&width=768 768w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0529/2376/0823/files/AMAZING_Our_story_with_The_New_York_Post_came_out_today_We_are_incredibly_proud_and_grateful.jpg?v=1778799923&width=1024 1024w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0529/2376/0823/files/AMAZING_Our_story_with_The_New_York_Post_came_out_today_We_are_incredibly_proud_and_grateful.jpg?v=1778799923&width=1280 1280w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0529/2376/0823/files/AMAZING_Our_story_with_The_New_York_Post_came_out_today_We_are_incredibly_proud_and_grateful.jpg?v=1778799923&width=1440 1440w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0529/2376/0823/files/AMAZING_Our_story_with_The_New_York_Post_came_out_today_We_are_in