ass="sc-kRRxPL iQTArD pf-419_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-kqGpvY cmTzNW pf-420_ pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="dd82f6bd-d3ab-43b2-b5c4-2630623c6994" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span>Do you use antibiotics or added hormones?</span></div></summary><div class="sc-dxcExB boHSLB pf-422_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-ijaoyg fLgXwO pf-423_"><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-424_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">No. Our animals are raised without added hormones or routine antibiotics.</p></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-kRRxPL iQTArD pf-426_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-kqGpvY cmTzNW pf-427_ pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="b235c426-3062-4c69-9423-ac1898ce6f6d" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span>How is your meat shipped?</span></div></summary><div class="sc-dxcExB boHSLB pf-429_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-ijaoyg fLgXwO pf-430_"><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-431_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">We ship frozen meat nationwide in insulated packaging with dry ice designed to keep your order cold during transit.</p></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-kRRxPL iQTArD pf-433_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-kqGpvY cmTzNW pf-434_ pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="b3f36e6b-047f-46a3-adec-1b62f6d338e3" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span>How long will the meat stay fresh?</span></div></summary><div class="sc-dxcExB boHSLB pf-436_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-ijaoyg fLgXwO pf-437_"><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-438_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Our meat is vacuum-sealed and frozen for maximum freshness. Most products can be stored in the freezer for up to 12 months.</p></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-kRRxPL iQTArD pf-440_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-kqGpvY cmTzNW pf-441_ pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="38e37aa9-cf26-475d-aeb7-fbeb901a822b" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span>Do I need a subscription?</span></div></summary><div class="sc-dxcExB boHSLB pf-443_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-ijaoyg fLgXwO pf-444_"><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-445_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">No. You can order whenever you’d like. We also offer optional subscription programs for customers who want regular deliveries and savings.</p></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-kRRxPL iQTArD pf-447_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-kqGpvY cmTzNW pf-448_ pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="822bddf8-b1bd-48ef-973b-d34055f900eb" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span>Why does your meat taste different than grocery store meat?</span></div></summary><div class="sc-dxcExB boHSLB pf-450_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-ijaoyg fLgXwO pf-451_"><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-452_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Most grocery store meat travels through a long supply chain before reaching your plate. Our meat is carefully sourced, expertly butchered, vacuum-sealed, and shipped directly to your home, resulting in exceptional flavor and quality.</p></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-kRRxPL iQTArD pf-454_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-kqGpvY cmTzNW pf-455_ pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="0dcda981-622e-42ee-b942-31bdf39a6b52" da